00:03:50,526 --> 00:03:56,526
Brian's Song is a drama, tv movie film directed by Buzz Kulik.

2
00:07:41,052 --> 00:07:47,052
Based on the real-life relationship between teammates Brian Piccolo and Gale Sayers
and the bond established when Piccolo discovers that he is dying.

3
